he higher you go)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-WEAPON WEIGHT IMPACT (each weapon has a different weight the more weapons you carry the slower you get)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-IK FOOT SLIDE(the foot shape is positioned according to the ground and you can slip and fall)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-HOOK WEAPON WILL HELP PLAYERS WHO FALL BEHIND TO MAKE EASY COMEBACKS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-MANY WEAPONS OF DIFFERENT TYPES AND CHARACTERISTICS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -PUNCH!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/extras/4f4e60e656e5568a645712a108ae5078.poster.avif?t=1753445465\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/extras/4f4e60e656e5568a645712a108ae5078.webm?t=1753445465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/extras/4f4e60e656e5568a645712a108ae5078.mp4?t=1753445465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
